#: picard/ui/options/genres.py:41
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body>\n"
"<p>Lines not starting with <b>-</b> or <b>+</b> are ignored.</p>\n"
"<p>One expression per line, case-insensitive</p>\n"
"<p>Examples:</p>\n"
"<p><b>\n"
"#comment<br/>\n"
"!comment<br/>\n"
"comment\n"
"</b></p>\n"
"<p><u>Strict filtering:</u></p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<b>-word</b>: exclude <i>word</i><br/>\n"
"<b>+word</b>: include <i>word</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><u>Wildcard filtering:</u></p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<b>-*word</b>: exclude all genres ending with <i>word</i><br/>\n"
"<b>+word*</b>: include all genres starting with <i>word</i><br/>\n"
"<b>+wor?</b>: include all genres starting with <i>wor</i> and ending with an "
"arbitrary character<br/>\n"
"<b>+wor[dk]</b>: include all genres starting with <i>wor</i> and ending with "
"<i>d</i> or <i>k</i><br/>\n"
"<b>-w*rd</b>: exclude all genres starting with <i>w</i> and ending with "
"<i>rd</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><u>Regular expressions filtering (Python re syntax):</u></p>\n"
"<p><b>-/^w.rd+/</b>: exclude genres starting with <i>w</i> followed by any "
"character, then <i>r</i> followed by at least one <i>d</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body>\n"
"<p>非以 <b>-</b> 或 <b>+</b> 開頭的行將被忽略。</p>\n"
"<p>一行一個運算式，不分大小寫</p>\n"
"<p>例：</p>\n"
"<p><b>\n"
"#註解<br/>\n"
"!註解<br/>\n"
"註解\n"
"</b></p>\n"
"<p><u>嚴格過濾：</u></p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<b>-word</b>：排除 <i>word</i><br/>\n"
"<b>+word</b>：包含 <i>word</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><u>萬用字元過濾：</u></p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<b>-*word</b>：排除所有以 <i>word</i> 結尾的流派<br/>\n"
"<b>+word*</b>：包含所有以 <i>word</i> 開頭的流派<br/>\n"
"<b>+wor?</b>：包含所有以 <i>wor</i> 開頭並以任何字元結尾的流派<br/>\n"
"<b>+wor[dk]</b>：包含所有以 <i>wor</i> 開頭並以 <i>d</i> 或 <i>k</i> 結尾的流"
"派<br/>\n"
"<b>-w*rd</b>：排除所有以 <i>w</i> 開頭並以 <i>rd</i> 結尾的流派\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><u>正規表示式過濾（Python 正規表示式語法）：</u></p>\n"
"<p><b>-/^w.rd+/</b>：排除以 <i>w</i> 開頭、其後為任何字元，然後是 <i>r</i> 之"
"後馬上是至少一個 <i>d</i> 的流派\n"
"</p>\n"
"</body></html>"

