#: picard/ui/options/releases.py:88
msgid ""
"When multiple releases match a file, types listed here are scored higher."
"<br>The top item gets the strongest preference.<br>Unlisted types are "
"treated neutrally."
msgstr ""
"當多個發行品符合某個檔案時，此處列出的類型會獲得較高的分數。<br>最上方的項目"
