#: picard/ui/options/releases.py:101
msgid ""
"Releases with these types are penalized when matching.<br>They will only be "
"chosen if no other release matches.<br>Useful for avoiding compilations, DJ-"
"mixes, etc."
msgstr ""
"具有這些類型的發行品在配對時會被扣分。<br>只有在沒有其他發行品符合時才會被選"
"中。<br>適合用來避免合輯、DJ 混音等。"

#: picard/ui/options/releases.py:117
